<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>9.10.2: Expanding from Factored Form to Standard Form</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02499</md:content-id>
    <md:title>9.10.2: Expanding from Factored Form to Standard Form</md:title>
    <md:uuid>e613e98c-3c47-4de8-8d8b-231d057b2969</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
    <section class="numbered-exercises" id="sect-00001"><title>Warm Up Activity</title>
      <para id="para-00001">Recall learning how to identify and factor perfect square trinomials in Unit 6. Here are some perfect squares in factored and standard forms, and an expression showing how the two forms are related.</para>
      <para id="para-00002">Study the first few examples in rows 1 and 2. Create a similar table to the one modeled below. Copy the table (or use a copy provided by your teacher) and then complete the missing numbers in rows 3 – 6 in the rest of the table.</para>
      <table class="unnumbered os-raise-wideadjustedtable" id="table-00001">
        <tgroup cols="4">
        
  <tbody>
            <row>
              <entry><emphasis>Row</emphasis></entry>
              <entry><emphasis>Factored Form</emphasis></entry>
              <entry><emphasis> </emphasis></entry>
              <entry><emphasis>Standard Form</emphasis></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00003">1</para>
              </entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00004"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00005"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00006"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00007">2</para>
              </entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00008"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00009"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00010"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00011">3</para>
              </entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00012"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00013"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00014"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00015">4</para>
              </entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00016"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00017"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00018"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>30</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00019">5</para>
              </entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00020"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00021"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00022"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
            </row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
        <para id="para-00027">1. Enter the missing values from row 3.</para>
      <table class="unnumbered os-raise-wideadjustedtable" id="table-00002">
        <tgroup cols="4">
        
  <tbody>
            <row>
              <entry><emphasis>Row</emphasis></entry>
              <entry><emphasis>Factored Form</emphasis></entry>
              <entry><emphasis> </emphasis></entry>
              <entry><emphasis>Standard Form</emphasis></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00023">3</para>
              </entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00024"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00025"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00026"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">a</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">b</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">c</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00040"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
            </row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
      <exercise id="dad71f78-dfbe-4ce8-84f6-174d080677d9" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00001">
          <para id="para-00028">a. What is the missing value of a?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00001">
          <para id="para-00030">The correct answer is 3.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="f8bd948f-e55c-410a-a56c-08a864670510" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00002">
          <para id="para-00032">b. What is the missing value of b?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00002">
          <para id="para-00034">The correct answer is -4.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_448b88de-78d0-428d-8320-b5d463cd72fe" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00003">
          <para id="para-00036">c. What is the missing value of c?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00003">
          <para id="para-00038">The correct answer is -4.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
        <para id="para-00029">2. Enter the missing values from row 4.</para>
      <table class="unnumbered os-raise-wideadjustedtable" id="table-00003">
        <tgroup cols="4">
        
  <tbody>
            <row>
              <entry><emphasis>Row</emphasis></entry>
              <entry><emphasis>Factored Form</emphasis></entry>
              <entry><emphasis> </emphasis></entry>
              <entry><emphasis>Standard Form</emphasis></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00039">4</para>
              </entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00041"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00042"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">a</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00068"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00069"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">b</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">c</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">d</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">e</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00070"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>30</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00103"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>30</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">f</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
            </row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
      <exercise id="a6b625d4-10aa-4150-ae58-791cf77361d7" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00004">
          <para id="para-00044">a. What is the missing value of a?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00004">
          <para id="para-00046">The correct answer is 3.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="d92d34c8-3b69-4bb0-b4de-ef514d6ed71b" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00005">
          <para id="para-00048">b. What is the missing value of b?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00005">
          <para id="para-00050">The correct answer is 5.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="eaa30f11-95c5-4267-a258-982376579f21" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00006">
          <para id="para-00052">c. What is the missing value of c?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00006">
          <para id="para-00054">The correct answer is 5.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_3b4c63db-6340-4d1c-86e9-ade95ce69455" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00007">
          <para id="para-00056">d. What is the missing value of d?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00007">
          <para id="para-00058">The correct answer is 3.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_1572d1cf-b757-4b6f-a8a0-e625692b3f7a" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00008">
          <para id="para-00060">e. What is the missing value of e?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00008">
          <para id="para-00062">The correct answer is 3.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_8a1ec2b2-3c19-48e7-9802-3a07306b4efd" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00009">
          <para id="para-00064">f. What is the missing value of f?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00009">
          <para id="para-00066">The correct answer is 9.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
        <para id="para-00031">3. Enter the missing values from row 5.</para>
      <table class="unnumbered os-raise-wideadjustedtable" id="table-00004">
        <tgroup cols="4">
        
  <tbody>
            <row>
              <entry><emphasis>Row</emphasis></entry>
              <entry><emphasis>Factored Form</emphasis></entry>
              <entry><emphasis> </emphasis></entry>
              <entry><emphasis>Standard Form</emphasis></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00067">5</para>
              </entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00104"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00105"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00106"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">a</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">b</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">c</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">d</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00107"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00108"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">e</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">f</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi mathvariant="bold">g</m:mi><m:mo mathvariant="bold">.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></entry>
            </row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
      <exercise id="_4605d8cb-adc0-47e9-9ddc-e7b5f0e8a1db" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00010">
          <para id="para-00072">a. What is the missing value of a?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00010">
          <para id="para-00074">The correct answer is <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="d0547d87-7153-4f40-9a1b-06ba89b584bf" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00011">
          <para id="para-00076">b. What is the missing value of b?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00011">
          <para id="para-00078">The correct answer is <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="e65eb74e-65af-419b-8402-a7feb616f885" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00012">
          <para id="para-00080">c. What is the missing value of c?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00012">
          <para id="para-00082">The correct answer is <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>m</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_37175167-199e-4386-a447-8ea590d9bf66" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00013">
          <para id="para-00084">d. What is the missing value of d?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00013">
          <para id="para-00086">The correct answer is <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>m</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_165fc1b2-9a9c-4672-be9f-506c9a8e9c4c" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00014">
          <para id="para-00088">e. What is the missing value of e?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00014">
          <para id="para-00090">The correct answer is <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_7f40aa1b-830a-44d8-9b8b-72ec21ac5abc" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00015">
          <para id="para-00092">f. What is the missing value of f?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00015">
          <para id="para-00094">The correct answer is <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mi>m</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_3b96c095-cbc3-4a4c-8611-b264e978aefa" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00016">
          <para id="para-00096">g. What is the missing value of g?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00016">
          <para id="para-00098">The correct answer is <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>m</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="exer-00001">
        <problem id="prob-00017">
          <para id="para-00099">4. Look at the expression in the last row of the table. If <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> is equivalent to <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>, how are <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>, and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>c</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> related to <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>m</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>?</para>
          <para id="para-00100">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00017">
          <para id="para-00101">Compare your answer: </para>
          <para id="para-00102"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mi>m</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>, and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
    </section>
  </content>
